= AYON File Cache =

#icon: opdef:/ayon::Sop/Sop/ayon_filecache::1.0?IconImage

"""Caches input geometry into an AYON versioned cache folder."""

== Overview ==

Wraps Houdini's File Cache SOP and builds the cache path from the AYON
context. Use **Save Cache** to write the current input to disk.

== Parameters ==

@parameters

Folder Path:
    AYON folder for the cache context.
Task Name:
    AYON task for the cache context.
Cache Root:
    Root folder for generated cache files.
Cache Name:
    Name of the cache folder.
Enable Version:
    Write the cache into a version folder.
Version:
    Cache version.
Evaluate As:
    Single Frame or Frame Range.
Simulation:
    Cache simulation frames through substeps.
Start/End/Inc:
    Frame range written by the File Cache.
Substeps:
    Number of simulation substeps.
Load:
    How the cached geometry is loaded.
Load from Disk:
    Read the cache back from disk instead of the input.
Overwrite Existing Cache:
    Allow Save to Disk or Save in Background to overwrite an existing
    cache version. Disabled by default.
Save Cache:
    Save the current input geometry.
Save to Disk in Background:
    Save the cache in a background process.
Cancel Cook:
    Cancel a running cache cook.
Next Version:
    Set Version to the next free version folder.

